# Normalize line endings to LF for all text files, regardless of each
# contributor's core.autocrlf setting. Without this, Prettier (which writes
# LF) and Windows checkouts (core.autocrlf=true converts to CRLF) disagree,
# and every `prettier --write` run makes dozens of files show as "modified"
# with zero real content change.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch line endings on these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
